      "node_id": "kg_doc_10",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Cypress is a conifer tree or shrub of northern temperate regions that belongs to the family Cupressaceae. The word \"cypress\" is derived from Old French \"cipres\", which was imported from Latin \"cypressus\", the latinisation of the Greek κυπάρισσος (\"kyparissos\").",
